orcement events, and API key lifecycle metrics over the last 24 hours, measured by dashboard rendering with live data.\n- CKS Prometheus scrape-target accessibility for MaaS endpoints is confirmed and documented (or the gap escalated to the xKS Platform / CoreWeave owners), measured by an active scrape target for maas-api.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-8 [P0]: Observability metrics functional: token usage, rate limiting enforcement, API key lifecycle events (integration/visibility portion).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":75567,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c8604ba3bb4d35d","agent_id":"a228e1c2340ee276c","session_id":"50e38564-4e5e-45db-b1e4-649369677e1e","uuid":"113877a2-f930-46b0-bec5-eca8adaa4fbc","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:34:22.690Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
