s structured JSON rate-limit enforcement logs including exceeded-quota events, measured by querying Grafana Loki during rate-limited traffic.\n- Both configurations are reproducible via the deployment mechanism selected for Kuadrant on xKS, measured by redeploying from configuration alone.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-10 [P1]: Observability logging functional: authentication events, rate limit enforcement (Kuadrant portion: Authorino auth decisions and Limitador rate-limit enforcement).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":77196,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c8604ba3bb4d35d","agent_id":"a228e1c2340ee276c","session_id":"50e38564-4e5e-45db-b1e4-649369677e1e","uuid":"cb063e33-011f-4daa-b0a1-30f0fa5300ef","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:34:44.708Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
