ntity provider) and the supported/required claim formats.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-12 [P2]: User identity flow documented for xKS deployments.\n72\t- Strategy acceptance criteria (User Management): user authentication strategy defined and documented; user identity flow documented.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a408e5be687f31bc","agent_id":"a2ebc6856d3219725","session_id":"50e38564-4e5e-45db-b1e4-649369677e1e","uuid":"e51bca7e-3425-48d9-a964-faeba381c7d0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:25:57.635Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8c09f98bf03a83d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8003 round 3"}
